    <h1>The Christian tradition is<br /> the <em>Christian&rsquo;s inheritance.</em></h1>
    <p class="lp-hero-sub">Read Christian theology from the early church to the early modern period. Search the works, compare translations with the original texts, and follow their sources.</p>
